B.aRc=s(["Write clean, efficient, and testable code for front-end (React, TypeScript) and back-end (Node.js, Python) systems to deliver robust healthcare applications.","Participate in architecture planning, system design, and code reviews to ensure scalability and maintainability of software solutions.","Ensure security standards, including HIPAA and GDPR, are integrated into all stages of the application lifecycle, from design to deployment.","Develop and integrate RESTful APIs, GraphQL endpoints, and database systems (e.g., PostgreSQL, MongoDB) for seamless data flow.","Troubleshoot and resolve production issues, ensuring high system uptime and performance under demanding workloads.","Collaborate with UX/UI designers and clinical teams to create intuitive, patient-centric interfaces that enhance user experience.","Implement automated testing frameworks (e.g., Jest, Cypress) to ensure code quality and reduce bugs in production.","Optimize application performance through code refactoring, caching strategies, and cloud infrastructure (e.g., AWS, Azure).","Stay updated on emerging technologies and propose innovative solutions to improve healthcare delivery platforms.","Document technical specifications and system architecture to support team collaboration and future maintenance."],t.s)
